---
title: Customize Typography & Shape
---

Typography and shape tokens sit under `typography` and `borderRadius` in `theme.json` — they apply across both light and dark modes.

## Font Family

`font-family` sets the font stack for the entire app. Replace it with any web-safe font or a font you load via CSS:

```json
"font-family": "Inter, sans-serif, system-ui, ui-sans-serif"
```

To use a Google Font, add it to the app's HTML `<head>` and reference it here:

```json
"font-family": "Roboto, sans-serif"
```

{% aside type="tip" %}
The app does not automatically load external fonts. If you use a custom font, make sure to add the `<link>` tag for it in `frontend/index.html`.
{% /aside %}

## Typography Scale

Each named scale entry appears under both `typography.desktop` and `typography.mobile` with three properties:

| Property | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `font-size` | Font size in pixels, such as `14px` |
| `line-height` | Line height in pixels, such as `20px` |
| `font-weight` | Weight (`400`, `500`, `600`) |

### Available scales

| Token | Default desktop / mobile size | Usage |
|-------|-------------------------------|-------|
| `headline` | `66px` / `32px` | Hero / page headlines |
| `subtitle` | `52px` / `30px` | Section subtitles |
| `heading-1` | `40px` / `28px` | H1 |
| `heading-2` | `32px` / `24px` | H2 |
| `heading-3` | `26px` / `20px` | H3 |
| `heading-4` | `20px` / `18px` | H4 |
| `body-extended` | `16px` / `16px` | Long-form body text |
| `body-extended-semibold` | `16px` / `16px` | Emphasized body text |
| `body-base` | `14px` / `14px` | Standard UI text |
| `body-base-semibold` | `14px` / `14px` | Labels, buttons |
| `caption` | `12px` / `12px` | Captions, helper text |
| `caption-semibold` | `12px` / `12px` | Emphasized captions |

### Example: compact body text

Apply the entry inside both the `desktop` and `mobile` trees:

```json
"body-base": {
  "font-size": "13px",
  "line-height": "18px",
  "font-weight": 400
}
```

## Border Radius

Six numeric radius tokens under `borderRadius` control the roundness of buttons, cards, dialogs, and other UI elements:

| Token | Default | Typical usage |
|-------|---------|---------------|
| `none` | `0` | Sharp corners |
| `extra-small` | `2` | Badges, chips |
| `small` | `4` | Inputs, small buttons |
| `medium` | `8` | Buttons, cards |
| `large` | `12` | Panels, modals |
| `extra-large` | `24` | Pills, large dialogs |

```json
"medium": 12,
"large": 16
```

You have updated the typography and shape. In the next step, you will sync the tokens and verify your changes in the browser.
